  "description": "Complete .NET SDK for CibPay payment processing API. Provides secure, easy-to-use\n      integration with Azerbaijan's CibPay banking system including order management,\n      certificate-based authentication, and comprehensive error handling. This single package\n      contains all necessary components: Core models, HTTP client, and SDK wrapper.",
