  "releaseNotes": "Preview release of CibPay .NET SDK featuring:\n      - Complete all-in-one package (no additional dependencies needed)\n      - Certificate-based authentication\n      - Order creation and retrieval\n      - Comprehensive error handling\n      - Async/await support\n      - Type-safe models\n      - Simple installation: dotnet add package CibPay.Sdk\n      - CibPay.Http Problem solved",
